msgstr "Preskoči celodnevne dogodke"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Skip events I declined"
msgstr "Preskoči dogodke, ki sem jih zavrnil"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid ""
"Popups and sounds for each kind of notification can also be set in System "
"Settings > Notifications > Event Calendar."
msgstr ""
"Pojavna okna in zvoke za vsako vrsto obvestil lahko nastavite tudi v "
"Sistemske nastavitve > Obvestila > Event Calendar."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Google Account"
msgstr "Googlov račun"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Google Account %1"
msgstr "Googlov račun %1"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Login failed: %1"
msgstr "Prijava ni uspela: %1"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Login complete."
msgstr "Prijava je končana."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Could not prepare Google login: %1"
msgstr "Ni bilo mogoče pripraviti prijave v Google: %1"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Waiting for browser callback..."
msgstr "Čakanje na odziv brskalnika..."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Waiting for the helper page to send the code..."
msgstr "Čakanje, da pomožna stran pošlje kodo..."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Sign-in timed out. Try again."
msgstr "Čas za prijavo je potekel. Poskusite znova."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Auto login failed. See logs for details."
msgstr "Samodejna prijava ni uspela. Podrobnosti so v dnevnikih."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Auto login failed: invalid callback data."
msgstr "Samodejna prijava ni uspela: neveljavni podatki odziva."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Auto login failed: %1"
msgstr "Samodejna prijava ni uspela: %1"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Auto login failed: authorization code missing."
msgstr "Samodejna prijava ni uspela: manjka avtorizacijska koda."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid ""
"The desktop could not open the browser automatically. Use the login link in "
"Advanced sign-in options instead."
msgstr ""
"Namizje ni moglo samodejno odpreti brskalnika. Namesto tega uporabite "
"povezavo za prijavo v naprednih možnostih prijave."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid ""
"Sign in to show your Google calendars and task lists. Your browser opens to "
"sign in; when access is granted the widget picks it up automatically."
msgstr ""
"Prijavite se, da bodo prikazani vaši Googlovi koledarji in seznami opravil. "
"Za prijavo se odpre brskalnik; ko je dostop odobren, ga gradnik samodejno "
"prevzame."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Sign In Again"
msgstr "Ponovno se prijavi"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Reload calendars and task lists"
msgstr "Znova naloži koledarje in sezname opravil"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Remove Account"
msgstr "Odstrani račun"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Remove"
msgstr "Odstrani"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid ""
"Google access for this account expired or was revoked. Sign in again to "
"reconnect it (the account and its settings are kept)."
msgstr ""
"Dostop do Googla za ta račun je potekel ali je bil preklican. Ponovno se "
"prijavite, da ga znova povežete (račun in njegove nastavitve se ohranijo)."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "The widget was updated. Sign in again to keep this account in sync."
msgstr ""
"Gradnik je bil posodobljen. Ponovno se prijavite, da bo ta račun ostal "
"usklajen."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "No calendars loaded yet. Use the reload button."
msgstr "Koledarji še niso naloženi. Uporabite gumb za ponovno nalaganje."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Task Lists"
msgstr "Seznami opravil"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Add Account…"
msgstr "Dodaj račun…"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Sign in with Google…"
msgstr "Prijava z Googlom…"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Waiting for the browser sign-in…"
msgstr "Čakanje na prijavo v brskalniku…"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Advanced sign-in options"
msgstr "Napredne možnosti prijave"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Your own Google OAuth client, or pasting the sign-in code by hand"
msgstr "Lasten odjemalec Google OAuth ali ročno lepljenje kode za prijavo"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Client Credentials"
msgstr "Poverilnice odjemalca"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid ""
"Using a previously stored Google OAuth client for compatibility. If login "
"still fails, add your own client ID and client secret."
msgstr ""
"Zaradi združljivosti se uporablja prej shranjen odjemalec Google OAuth. Če "
"prijava še vedno ne uspe, dodajte svoj ID in skrivnost odjemalca."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Try desktop built-in client (no secret)"
msgstr "Poskusi vgrajeni namizni odjemalec (brez skrivnosti)"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Client ID"
msgstr "ID odjemalca"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Optional"
msgstr "Izbirno"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Client Secret"
msgstr "Skrivnost odjemalca"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid ""
"Leave these empty to use the built-in client. A custom client must be a "
"Google Cloud OAuth Desktop client, or a Web client with its secret and the "
"redirect URI set to %1."
msgstr ""
"Pustite prazno za uporabo vgrajenega odjemalca. Odjemalec po meri mora biti "
"namizni odjemalec Google Cloud OAuth ali spletni odjemalec s skrivnostjo in "
"URI-jem za preusmeritev, nastavljenim na %1."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid ""
"For a custom OAuth client, publish the OAuth consent screen to Production. "
"Google expires refresh tokens for external apps left in Testing after seven "
"days; Workspace session controls can also require reauthorization."
msgstr ""
"Za odjemalca OAuth po meri objavite zaslon za soglasje OAuth v produkcijo "
"(Production). Google zunanjim aplikacijam, ki ostanejo v testiranju "
"(Testing), po sedmih dneh razveljavi žetone za osvežitev; nadzor sej v "
"Workspace lahko prav tako zahteva ponovno avtorizacijo."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Manual Sign-in"
msgstr "Ročna prijava"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Login (Auto) - Add Account"
msgstr "Prijava (samodejna) - Dodaj račun"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Login (Auto)"
msgstr "Prijava (samodejna)"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid ""
"Click Login (Auto) to open <a href=\"%1\">%2</a>. After you grant access, "
"the browser redirects to a localhost URL. If auto-capture succeeds you can "
"ignore the field below; otherwise copy the full URL (or just the code) and "
"paste it."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite Prijava (samodejna), da odprete <a href=\"%1\">%2</a>. Ko odobrite "
"dostop, vas brskalnik preusmeri na URL localhost. Če samodejni zajem uspe, "
"lahko spodnje polje prezrete; sicer kopirajte celoten URL (ali samo kodo) in "
"ga prilepite."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid ""
"Click Login (Auto) to open <a href=\"%1\">%2</a>. After you grant access, "
"the browser redirects to the helper page and will try to send the code back "
"automatically. If it fails, copy the code and paste it below."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite Prijava (samodejna), da odprete <a href=\"%1\">%2</a>. Ko odobrite "
"dostop, vas brskalnik preusmeri na pomožno stran, ki bo poskusila samodejno "
"poslati kodo nazaj. Če ne uspe, kopirajte kodo in jo prilepite spodaj."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "The desktop could not open the browser automatically."
msgstr "Namizje ni moglo samodejno odpreti brskalnika."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Copy Link"
msgstr "Kopiraj povezavo"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Helper page (optional): <a href=\"%1\">%1</a>"
msgstr "Pomožna stran (izbirno): <a href=\"%1\">%1</a>"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Helper page: <a href=\"%1\">%1</a>"
msgstr "Pomožna stran: <a href=\"%1\">%1</a>"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid ""
"If your browser shows a connection error, that's expected. Copy the URL from "
"the address bar anyway and paste it below. If auto-capture works, you do not "
"need to paste anything."
msgstr ""
"Če brskalnik prikaže napako povezave, je to pričakovano. Vseeno kopirajte "
"URL iz naslovne vrstice in ga prilepite spodaj. Če samodejni zajem deluje, "
"vam ni treba ničesar prilepiti."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid ""
"If auto-capture fails, copy the code from the helper page and paste it below."
